{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_spearman","model_identifier":"halfling_spearman","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_spearman\n\nHalfling spearman (A1), male body, 1.5 m = 53 u (55 with the iron cap).\n\nHalfling male in a stitched leather jerkin over his farm clothes, bloom-iron cap, shortspear and round-ish buckler. Fights on foot and as the front rider of the halfling war ox. Baseline skeleton and slot names; weapons are preview groups inside the slots, as in warrior_base.\n\n- Cubes: 28 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.0..11.0, y 0.0..55.2, z -7.0..5.8 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 55 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `guard` | 2 | loop | spear levelled at the hip, buckler forward, left foot leading |\n| `thrust` | 0.7 | once | key 0.32 s: spear point reaches full extension (stab, one target) |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | spear held upright at his side |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch with the buckler arm thrown up |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on his back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `sit_ride` | 1 | loop | seated astride with spear levelled; gentle bob for the ox gait |\n| `ride_thrust` | 0.8 | once | key 0.36 s: downward stab from the saddle (one target) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 37.3 u/s (1.05 m/s), cycle 0.9 s\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `thrust`: key 0.32 s: spear point reaches full extension (stab, one target)\n- `ride_thrust`: key 0.36 s: downward stab from the saddle (one target)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 35, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 39, 6)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 33, -8)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12.5, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (7.5, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-7.5, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `shortspear` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 1.6 m (57 u), bloom-iron leaf head; grip 17 u from the butt, point 41 u forward of the grip\n- `buckler` (visible, under slot_hand_l): about 30 cm (11 u), planks and an iron boss, held in the fist (face points -X with the arm hanging)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Riding: sit_ride and ride_thrust keep the hips at their own pivot (0, 21, 0); place that point on the war ox `slot_rider`. Legs straddle at 38 deg splay for the ox's broad back.\n- The iron cap is a helmet layer (inflate 1.25) baked into this model; separate copies of the halfling equipment are in /workspace/sac/models/halfling_equipment/.\n"},"description":"# halfling_spearman\n\nHalfling spearman (A1), male body, 1.5 m = 53 u (55 with the iron cap).\n\nHalfling male in a stitched leather jerkin over his farm clothes, bloom-iron cap, shortspear and round-ish buckler. Fights on foot and as the front rider of the halfling war ox. Baseline skeleton and slot names; weapons are preview groups inside the slots, as in warrior_base.\n\n- Cubes: 28 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.0..11.0, y 0.0..55.2, z -7.0..5.8 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 55 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `guard` | 2 | loop | spear levelled at the hip, buckler forward, left foot leading |\n| `thrust` | 0.7 | once | key 0.32 s: spear point reaches full extension (stab, one target) |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | spear held upright at his side |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch with the buckler arm thrown up |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on his back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `sit_ride` | 1 | loop | seated astride with spear levelled; gentle bob for the ox gait |\n| `ride_thrust` | 0.8 | once | key 0.36 s: downward stab from the saddle (one target) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 37.3 u/s (1.05 m/s), cycle 0.9 s\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `thrust`: key 0.32 s: spear point reaches full extension (stab, one target)\n- `ride_thrust`: key 0.36 s: downward stab from the saddle (one target)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 35, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 39, 6)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 33, -8)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12.5, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (7.5, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-7.5, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `shortspear` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 1.6 m (57 u), bloom-iron leaf head; grip 17 u from the butt, point 41 u forward of the grip\n- `buckler` (visible, under slot_hand_l): about 30 cm (11 u), planks and an iron boss, held in the fist (face points -X with the arm hanging)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Riding: sit_ride and ride_thrust keep the hips at their own pivot (0, 21, 0); place that point on the war ox `slot_rider`. Legs straddle at 38 deg splay for the ox's broad back.\n- The iron cap is a helmet layer (inflate 1.25) baked into this model; separate copies of the halfling equipment are in /workspace/sac/models/halfling_equipment/.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128}